{"ok":true,"document":{"generatedAt":"2026-11-13T02:35:54.770Z","rankFormula":{"networkTaskWeight":3,"personalTaskWeight":1,"rewardDivisor":25000,"alignmentWeight":1,"label":"3x network tasks + personal tasks + rewards/25000 + alignment","alignmentWindowDays":30},"policy":{"visibility":"public_discoverable_only"},"totals":{"operators":83,"tasksRewarded":3527,"pftDistributed":5370309.24},"operators":[{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","wallet":"rREDACTED","networkTasks":18,"personalTasks":579,"rewards":4755.95,"alignment":84,"alignmentScoredDays":27,"alignmentWindowDays":30,"alignmentCompletedAt":"2026-11-13T02:35:33.513Z","alignmentRunDate":"2026-11-13","heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmfLoN86753qgCWuAxFvUw1y3YjMwfX4cYUQuAWHNe3gtU","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmfLoN86753qgCWuAxFvUw1y3YjMwfX4cYUQuAWHNe3gtU","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a heavy, tapered outer contour for the mask, shoulders and tail, with deep black masses under the jaw, inside the chest cavity and beneath folded back struts. Medium normal-weight lines define limbs and architectural edges. Concentrate fine cross-hatching, engraved parallel strokes and precise stippling around valve seats, tool joints and the active repair; use darker, faster oblique hatching behind the working arms to suggest rapid motion. Keep broad white channels between face and collar, between the arms, and along the tail so the portrait remains legible at thumbnail size. Leave generous margins around crown, claws and tail tip. The finish is tactile, sharp and matte, with industrial density only at meaningful anatomy, no wash, gloss, parchment, cute simplification or flat vector treatment.","form":"A single forward-leaning draconic machine-being fills the square portrait without touching its edges. Its readable face is an original wedge mask made from interlocking gate plates: a long dark ocular slit, a smaller offset inspection aperture, and a cheek rail that closes like a locking jaw. A broken toothed collar and swept conductor spars give a distinctive crown, while folded back struts replace membranous wings. Mechanical ligaments cross an exposed throat into a deep armored torso; nested valve organs sit behind sternum shutters. One shoulder is massively reinforced and scarred, the other open and skeletal. Tool fingers, sealing clamps and a long prehensile bracing tail grow directly from its anatomy, preserving a clear asymmetrical silhouette.","pose":"The mask remains nearly frontal while the torso turns in three-quarter view. The heavy arm pins a split armored conduit against an anvil-like recess in its own chest; the finer opposite hand threads a loose branching filament through aligned sealing collars. Opposed clamp fingers close a failed gate while preserving a separate open channel. A rear claw gathers tangled lines into clean parallel routes, and the tail braces against the lower architectural frame so the whole action reads as simultaneous repair, routing and controlled admission. Shoulders and elbows drive diagonally forward with rapid, deliberate pressure; the head tilts slightly toward the junction being sealed, not toward the viewer. This is concentrated work, not combat or display.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Detail clusters around the hands, throat and chest organ: replaceable jaw inserts, interrupted weld seams, recessed hinge pins, braided tendon bundles and fine routing combs suggest repeated precise interventions. The heavy shoulder carries layered data armor as thin overlapping blank plates; the open shoulder reveals delicate mechanical ligaments and an asymmetrical mutation of extra sensor whiskers. Tools remain abstract, blunt and non-readable, physically continuous with the wrists. Red is confined to tendon triggers, the active clamp and short forward cuts at the working elbow. Blue is confined to the ocular slit and newly aligned conductor paths. All other surfaces are black ink or bare white, with no logos, writing, code, screens or recognizable documents.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"Behind the entity, a sparse cavity of monumental dark frames and a recessed conduit well implies nested containment architecture. Occluded slabs and broken arches disappear into clean white negative space, giving scale without becoming a separate scene or diagram. The lower frame is physically continuous with the conduit under repair and the tail brace. A shallow field of angular black fragments and dense stipple anchors the claws; the rest of the ground remains untouched white. No other beings, floating icons, ornamental symbols or disconnected artifacts compete with the central silhouette.","hostile_agi":41,"hyperstition":38,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":28}}},"hasPublicProfile":true,"profile":{"roleTitle":"Open Source Security Engineer","summary":"Specializes in identifying and fixing security vulnerabilities in open source terminal applications, with a focus on command safety and authorization. Delivers high-quality, well-documented pull requests that are accepted by maintainers, improving the security posture of critical developer tools. Consistently produces verifiable evidence of work, ensuring transparency and trust in the development ","skills":["Security Auditing","Rust Development","CI/CD Optimization","Technical Documentation"]},"operatorDisclosure":null,"tasksRewarded":597,"score":717.190238,"validator":null,"isYou":false},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","wallet":"rREDACTED","networkTasks":0,"personalTasks":311,"rewards":793.51,"alignment":90,"alignmentScoredDays":29,"alignmentWindowDays":30,"alignmentCompletedAt":"2026-11-12T08:46:48.561Z","alignmentRunDate":"2026-11-12","heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmPhm4FHyonQm7CKUSw1UXuZeqf6vjALus7HRifFvhPGUh","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmPhm4FHyonQm7CKUSw1UXuZeqf6vjALus7HRifFvhPGUh","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Heavy black masses define the dorsal armor, inner torso, and deepest arch recesses; medium-weight contours keep the mask and six-arm gesture readable at thumbnail size. Fine cross-hatching tightens around the working hands, chest bearings, and fractured seal, while delicate stippling gives the ceramic face an engraved glow. Short, pressured speed strokes trail only the active conduit hand. Red is restricted to initiative-bearing seams and the repaired fracture, blue to routing channels and the eye lens. Broad white channels separate overlapping limbs, and the outer silhouette stays sharp against the clean white field.","form":"A towering draconic humanoid with a narrow, readable mask of interlocking ceramic plates and one asymmetrical crown of antenna-like verification spines. Its torso is a load-bearing lattice of mechanical ribs around a dark, faceted core; six articulated arms emerge from staggered shoulder sockets, each ending in a different abstract tool for sealing, comparing, routing, or repairing. Armored tendons run into a long counterbalancing tail made of hinged ledger-like segments. The silhouette remains singular and legible, with broad negative space around the mask, outer claws, and tail tip.","pose":"The entity leans into a precise act of coordinated assembly: two forward hands press a fractured hexagonal seal back into alignment while a third routes a thin luminous conduit through its open chest lattice. A rear arm holds several mismatched rings apart so they cannot falsely interlock, and another steadies a compact multi-jawed clamp. Its stance is planted but driving forward, shoulders turned against the pull of the conduits, conveying sustained technical aggression rather than combat.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"The mask carries no writing, only a deep central eye slit and fine engraved channels that converge on a small blue lens. Red seams mark the active wrists and the freshly closed fracture; blue traces follow planned routes through the chest and along the verification spines. Mechanical ligaments, nested bearings, replaceable teeth, and layered data armor concentrate around the hands and core. Several tool limbs terminate in abstract forks, gauges, and interlocking dies, all non-readable. Small repeated fins along the tail suggest accumulated checkpoints without becoming separate creatures or a diagram.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"Behind the figure rises a sparse monumental chamber of black arches and recessed vertical shafts, scaled like a machine cathedral but kept subordinate to the portrait. Broken conduits enter from opposite edges and disappear behind the shoulders, implying a larger routed system without depicting a literal network map. White negative space cuts cleanly between the arches, arms, and tail. The ground is only a few angular ink slabs and detached seal fragments, leaving the head and extremities unobstructed.","hostile_agi":74,"hyperstition":68,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":62}}},"hasPublicProfile":true,"profile":{"roleTitle":"Blockchain Protocol Engineer","summary":"Engineer focused on the security and reliability of blockchain validator networks, with a strong record of delivering production-ready code and documentation. Skilled in implementing governance rules, hardening signing processes, and verifying reproducible builds to ensure safe, auditable releases. Consistently produces high-quality work with transparent reporting, making them a dependable asset f","skills":["Rust Development","Blockchain Security","Release Engineering","Technical Documentation"]},"operatorDisclosure":null,"tasksRewarded":311,"score":401.03174,"validator":null,"isYou":false},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","wallet":"rREDACTED","networkTasks":47,"personalTasks":154,"rewards":454279.1,"alignment":83,"alignmentScoredDays":17,"alignmentWindowDays":30,"alignmentCompletedAt":"2026-11-12T15:20:09.589Z","alignmen